      "writtenOn": "2024-10-10T18:11:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I should have removed the no-longer-needed visibility-related changes.  I\u0027ve removed the deps on `core_priv`, `core`, and `base`, because everything still builds after removing those deps.  So, let me for now remove the visibility-related changes and we can discuss if those dependencies may be needed after all.\n\nIIUC these dependencies are not needed, because IIUC Bazel\u0027s sandbox means that if they were needed then the build would fail.  For example, if I remove the `png_decode` dependency, then I get `./experimental/rust_png/impl/SkPngRustCodec.h:15:10: fatal error: \u0027src/codec/SkPngCodecBase.h\u0027 file not found` and if Iremove the `any_decoder` dependency then I get `./experimental/rust_png/impl/SkPngRustCodec.h:14:10: fatal error: \u0027src/codec/SkFrameHolder.h\u0027 file not found`.\n\nOTOH, maybe those dependencies are still needed, because I see that `SkPngRustCodec.cpp` includes things like `src/base/SkAutoMalloc.h` ([part of `base.hdrs`](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/skia/src/base/BUILD.bazel;l\u003d106;drc\u003dd06dc084d39754cd3cb41e15fb3f92be89688c0d)) even though the `any_decoder` \u003d\u003e `base` is [declared in `deps`](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/skia/src/codec/BUILD.bazel;l\u003d60;drc\u003d5fb36dd08a257623ee0738747286de09662e4591), rather than in `public_deps`.\n\nI dunno.  WDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "d325ff41_4a335e8b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 31,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 31,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "7ed60063f3056af824e8edf468fe561e834f2fe6",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
